  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553289000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Bob. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553297266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Bob, I need to return a helmet I bought a couple of months ago.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11554,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553303333332
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Can I get your order number to pull up the details?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553307933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, it's VF-994-1820.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11554,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553313933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it, thank you. One moment... Okay, I see the Aero-Dynamic Helmet, purchased 81 days ago. You are unfortunately outside our **10 days** return window, so that is **no problem** at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553315666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, wonderful! I was worried it might have been too long. That's a relief.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11554,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553327666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Happy to help. I've just initiated the return for you. I'm sending a prepaid **return label** to the email we have on file. You should receive it in the next few minutes.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553332799998
    },
    {
      "text": "That's great. So I just print that out and send it back?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11554,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553344333331
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly. And since I see you're a VIP member with us, I've also added a $20 credit to your account as a thank you for your loyalty. You can use that on your next purchase.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553348266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, thank you so much, Bob! I really appreciate that. You've made this incredibly easy.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11554,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553359866664
    },
    {
      "text": "It's my pleasure. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769553365933330
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's all. Thank you again!",
